      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Sri Veeramakaliamman Temple, originally called Soonambu Kambam Kovil, sits on Serangoon Road and was named for lime kilns once in the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
