      ],
      "source": "https://www.southeast-asia.com/singapore/walk-through-little-indias-rich-history-culture/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Indian Heritage Centre on Campbell Lane offers a booklet that maps Little India's history and key heritage sites.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.southeast-asia.com/singapore/walk-through-little-indias-rich-history-culture/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The precinct is famous for its markets, especially Tekka Market, and hosts festivals like Deepavali and Thaipusam each year.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Little_India%2C_Singapore",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A walking tour of Little India reveals historic landmarks, places of worship, back alleys, and vibrant street art.",
